ranscript contents, then capture a tightly cropped screenshot under C:/Users/khair/Code Projects/fork-superset-windows-arm64/tmp/post-install-e2e/. No clicks, focus changes, or other actions. sanctioned_irreversible: none. Success: report hwnd/title, visible nonblank evidence, route/workspace if safely observable, screenshot full path. Keep sensitive content out of report.","outputFile":"C:\\Users\\khair\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-khair-Code-Projects-fork-superset-windows-arm64\\083b7de7-951b-4059-a4aa-3dd81cb5a6cf\\tasks\\accf68f294691b54e.output","canReadOutputFile":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"164906b4-3685-4527-8f3f-d4de850366c9","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.228","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
