{"parentUuid":"0d1e59be-2120-4d62-9526-24b557949958","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"resp_0a5d54671a3a1519016a7c738b72188191a9b68dfe0bf8b405","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"codex-gpt-5-6-sol","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":562,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":221696,"output_tokens":377,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Implemented, validated, and pushed the fixes to `main`.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- **Stale visible picker**\n  - PTY acknowledgment still returns `confirmed` only after daemon acknowledgment and durable ledger readback.\n  - The bridge no longer retracts the pending question immediately at PTY acknowledgment.\n  - Exact positive `PostToolUse`/`tool_result` evidence now settles and retracts it.\n  - A best-effort PTY resize nudge forces Claude to repaint after consuming the answer.\n  - Repaint failure can never block, refuse, or downgrade the answer.\n\n- **Duplicate-write fencing**\n  - Added durable transactional `claimed → in_flight` arbitration.\n  - A fresh request cannot retype an answer already delivered or possibly delivered.\n  - Restart behavior is covered by real SQLite tests.\n\n- **Pairing secret logging**\n  - The QR URI and single-use pairing code are no longer logged.\n  - Logs contain only the non-secret pairing reference and expiry.\n\n### Verification\n\n- Full companion suite: **215 passed, 0 failed**\n- Real SQLite fence tests: passed\n- Feature markers: **147/147**\n- ReferenceError gate: clean across all 7 shipped packages\n- Scoped Biome: clean\n- `/simplify`: completed\n- Two `/code-review low` passes: no findings\n- Working tree: clean and synchronized with `origin/main`\n\n### Pushed commits\n\n- `408ecc9c5` — `fix(host-service): settle companion answers after Claude consumes them`\n- `5bc2dd144` — `fix(host-service): keep claimed status internal`\n\nFull Windows ARM64 publish build is running:\n\nhttps://github.com/khairm/superset-windows-arm64/actions/runs/31601012858\n\nI will not install it without separate exact-time authorization."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_details":null},"attributionSkill":"simplify","type":"assistant","uuid":"c84af5df-6a64-4036-95cf-fc6596d5dee0","timestamp":"2026-08-12T13:22:27.983Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.228","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
