on/consistency; 4 and 6 are footgun-shaped but behaviour-neutral as written.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>79987</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>30</tool_uses><duration_ms>236635</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
