r import from `question-freshness.test.ts`) and match the sibling naming.\n\n9. `packages/host-service/src/companion/answer-settlement-events.test.ts:63-74` — hand-built `NotifyingSinkDeps` with per-field `as never` casts on `push` and `events`. `question-freshness.test.ts:168-192` already has a `sink(summarize, publish)` builder producing exactly this shape with one honest `as unknown as NotifyingSinkDeps`. Cost: `as never` on a dep object is the weakest possible cast — it accepts any future required field silently; and the same builder now exists twice with different fidelity. Reuse: promote that `sink()` helper alongside finding 8's fixtures.\n\nNothing found in `attempt-ledger.ts` / `attempt-ledger.test.ts` — the `toLedgerFailureCode` + `isLedgerFailureCode` split now reuses the read-boundary check at `attempt-ledger.ts:552`, which is correct.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>87540</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>20</tool_uses><duration_ms>240138</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
