{"parentUuid":"12a03cda-c71f-4c57-9ef8-614043377bbf","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"44611460-2829-462e-b2e9-af8e653be0db","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_poxxGZ4MM82DtW08cNewgqyV","type":"tool_result","content":"## main...origin/main\n4a9978200 test(host-service): simplify answer lock fixtures\n692ce7dae fix(host-service): preserve answer race outcomes\n5bc2dd144 fix(host-service): keep claimed status internal\n408ecc9c5 fix(host-service): settle companion answers after Claude consumes them","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"50ea130a-9260-414d-ad1c-a666393eac4c","timestamp":"2026-08-12T14:07:45.051Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## main...origin/main\n4a9978200 test(host-service): simplify answer lock fixtures\n692ce7dae fix(host-service): preserve answer race outcomes\n5bc2dd144 fix(host-service): keep claimed status internal\n408ecc9c5 fix(host-service): settle companion answers after Claude consumes them","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"12a03cda-c71f-4c57-9ef8-614043377bbf","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.228","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
{"parentUuid":"50ea130a-9260-414d-ad1c-a666393eac4c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"resp_059a19c9a6078e38016a7c7e357ba8819188c51c8e1561a2bf","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"codex-gpt-5-6-sol","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":592,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":244224,"output_tokens":318,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The late review caught two real race defects. I cancelled both superseded builds before shipment and fixed them:\n\n- **Zero-write failures remain retryable**\n  - A failure while the durable row is still `claimed` is now recorded as `failed`, never `unconfirmed`.\n  - Only `in_flight` attempts—where bytes may have moved—can become `unconfirmed`.\n  - A transient pre-write DB/lock failure can no longer fence an unanswered picker permanently.\n\n- **PostToolUse-first provenance is corrected**\n  - If Claude settles before remote provenance is attached, clients receive a corrective resolution event identifying the phone/watch.\n  - This is tested through the actual event-publishing wrapper, not merely the in-memory question store.\n\nFinal verification:\n\n- Full companion suite: **219 passed, 0 failed**\n- Focused race tests: **45 passed, 0 failed**\n- Feature markers: **147/147**\n- REFERR gate: clean\n- Biome: clean\n- `/simplify`: completed\n- `/code-review low`: no findings\n- Repository clean and pushed to `main`\n\nFinal commits:\n\n- `692ce7dae` — `fix(host-service): preserve answer race outcomes`\n- `4a9978200` — `test(host-service): simplify answer lock fixtures`\n\nFinal replacement ARM64 build is running on the exact final SHA:\n\nhttps://github.com/khairm/superset-windows-arm64/actions/runs/31605016224\n\nI will not install it without separate exact-time authorization."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_details":null},"attributionSkill":"simplify","type":"assistant","uuid":"b6229b0d-1ea8-4af9-9d35-0d0adc018b9c","timestamp":"2026-08-12T14:08:01.617Z","effort":"high","session_id":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\khair\\Code Projects\\fork-superset-windows-arm64","sessionId":"41b65f55-7b51-4cfd-82d1-d1d1eec49d91","version":"2.1.228","gitBranch":"main","slug":"jolly-singing-lemur"}
